# Known bug: a copy given "for as long as" a condition (Duration::AsLongAs) is never undone when the condition lapses: only the end-of-turn cleanup restores a permanent's earlier copiable values (CR 611.2b, 707.2).
# Assimilation Aegis: "for as long as this Equipment remains attached to it, that creature becomes a copy of a creature card
# exiled with this Equipment" (CR 611.2b, 707.2). Two equips are paid for at once, the second one on the stack resolving
# first: Equip {2} on the first Ornithopter makes it a Llanowar Elves (Bot2's, exiled
# by the Equipment). Equipping the second moves the Equipment: the first is an Ornithopter again (0/2) and the second is the
# Elves (1/1): the copy ends where the Equipment no longer is, and starts again on the creature it becomes attached to.

